  "_comment": "Shared components the server's model families need, installed under MODELS_DIR (a Podman volume in the container setup): the FLUX.2-klein text encoder and VAE, the TRELLIS.2 image encoder and decoders. The main models (a FLUX.2-klein diffusion model, a set of TRELLIS.2 flow models) are options the user adds (app/model_store.py); \"suggestions\" lists known ones. Portable across engine packages (catalog/engines.json): GGUF and safetensors files work with the ROCm, CUDA and Metal builds alike. Pinned by URL (fixed release / revision), size and SHA256; read by app/model_setup.py. Bumping one means updating url, size and sha256 together and recording the change in CHANGELOG.md.",
